# Lifecycle (master)
// Create a workspace, download its config, boot a sidecar from it, check the sidecar, delete the workspace.
// Warehouse calls, the sidecar boot (MB_CONFIG_FILE_PATH=config.yml) and transform runs are not API operations,
// so they are not steps.
mbcode -> parent: createWorkspace {id, databases.database_id, databases.status, databases.output_namespace}
mbcode -> parent: getWorkspaceConfig
mbcode -> sidecar: getCurrentWorkspace {data}
mbcode -> parent: deleteWorkspace
